{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786606248940,"sessionID":"ses_005f8753effeWyZ221Ua5lmfEm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_03_AhugHHLx8KmgPGKvfm4i0574","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0144-system-deep-loop-036-p0-remediation/specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/manifest/phase-tree.json"},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0144-system-deep-loop-036-p0-remediation/specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/manifest/phase-tree.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"packet\": \"system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation\",\n3:   \"kind\": \"phase-parent\",\n4:   \"generated_from\": \"GPT-5.6-sol (ultra) design review, verdict REQUESTED_CHANGES, folded in\",\n5:   \"architecture\": \"single cross-mode spine: typed append-only event ledger + fail-closed transition-authorization gateway + sealed reference artifacts + versioned replay fingerprints + receipts/certificates + blinded/counterfactual adjudication\",\n6:   \"migration_model\": \"additive-dark substrate -> compatibility adapters + shadow parity -> staged per-mode authority cutover behind rollback window -> gated legacy retirement\",\n7:   \"live_direct_children\": 44,\n8:   \"original_program_range\": \"001-017\",\n9:   \"rec_corpus\": { \"run_a_45iter\": 8, \"run_b_20iter\": 59, \"run_c_40iter\": 111, \"total\": 178 },\n10:   \"phases\": [\n11:     { \"phase\": \"001\", \"slug\": \"deep-loop-market-research\", \"kind\": \"research\", \"depends_on\": [], \"outcome\": \"Read-only research input: 8 ranked recommendations (R1-R8) and the market/landscape analysis consumed by the phase-004 ledger.\" },\n12:     { \"phase\": \"002\", \"slug\": \"deep-loop-effectiveness-and-fanout\", \"kind\": \"research\", \"depends_on\": [], \"outcome\": \"Read-only research input: 59 runtime recommendations + fan-out finding (run 1) and 111 per-mode recommendations (run 2), consumed by the phase-004 ledger.\" },\n13:     { \"phase\": \"003\", \"slug\": \"baseline-taxonomy-and-state-census\", \"kind\": \"leaf\", \"depends_on\": [], \"outcome\": \"Pin BASE; normalize taxonomy; census subsystems, event schemas, in-flight state, backends, defects-vs-contracts, replay fixtures, rollback anchors.\" },\n14:     { \"phase\": \"004\", \"slug\": \"architecture-coverage-and-transition-contract\", \"kind\": \"parent\", \"depends_on\": [\"003\"], \"outcome\": \"Ratify the spine (ADR); freeze the bijective 178-row classified rec ledger (stable IDs, normalized targets, single disposition); define transition/versioning/compat/cutover/rollback policy before any writer.\" },\n15:     { \"phase\": \"005\", \"slug\": \"fanout-live-tools-unblock\", \"kind\": \"leaf\", \"depends_on\": [\"004\"], \"outcome\": \"Early backward-compatible liveTools.webSearch policy + capability matrix + executor adapters + manifest expansion on fanout-run.cjs; dispatch-only, no canonical-persistence change.\" },\n16:     { \"phase\": \"006\", \"slug\": \"transition-authorized-ledger-core\", \"kind\": \"parent\", \"depends_on\": [\"004\"], \"outcome\": \"Versioned event envelope + typed append-only ledger + replay fingerprints + fail-closed transition-authorization gateway, co-landed; dark, legacy authoritative.\" },\n17:     { \"phase\": \"007\", \"slug\": \"shared-evidence-and-control-services\", \"kind\": \"parent\", \"depends_on\": [\"006\"], \"outcome\": \"Receipts + effect-recovery gateway; sealed reference-artifact mechanism; blinded/counterfactual adjudication service; hierarchical typed budgets; stream-fold gauges; locks/fencing; continuity identities.\" },\n18:     { \"phase\": \"008\", \"slug\": \"compatibility-shadow-and-rollback-bridge\", \"kind\": \"parent\", \"depends_on\": [\"006\", \"007\"], \"outcome\": \"Upcasters + dual-read/single-write adapters + legacy projections; shadow-parity harness; in-flight-state classification (upcast/pin/fork/migrate/block); rollback drills. No authority cutover.\" },\n19:     { \"phase\": \"009\", \"slug\": \"fanout-fanin-durable-orchestration\", \"kind\": \"parent\", \"depends_on\": [\"005\", \"006\", \"007\", \"008\"], \"outcome\": \"Canonical dispatch receipts, result envelopes, resume/salvage, logical branch IDs, leases, waves, conditional budget-aware fan-in, partial-failure policy, provenance-balanced reduction.\" },\n20:     { \"phase\": \"010\", \"slug\": \"novelty-claims-continuity-and-projections\", \"kind\": \"parent\", \"depends_on\": [\"008\", \"009\"], \"outcome\": \"Semantic communities, contradiction + supersession events, claim continuity, next-focus semantics, deterministic transactional projections/gauges.\" },\n21:     { \"phase\": \"011\", \"slug\": \"convergence-termination-and-health\", \"kind\": \"parent\", \"depends_on\": [\"006\", \"007\", \"009\", \"010\"], \"outcome\": \"Path-covering termination, cycle detection, stopping clocks, value-of-computation + adaptive allocation, generic health + degeneration harness. After fan-in + novelty because it consumes them.\" },\n22:     { \"phase\": \"012\", \"slug\": \"shared-mode-contracts-and-fixtures\", \"kind\": \"parent\", \"depends_on\": [\"008\", \"009\", \"010\", \"011\"], \"outcome\": \"Freeze shared mode interfaces, hoist cross-mode closures, mixed-version fixtures, executable dependency + write-set conflict graph for parallel-safe mode work.\" },\n23:     { \"phase\": \"013\", \"slug\": \"mode-and-lane-migrations\", \"kind\": \"parent\", \"children_count\": 8, \"depends_on\": [\"012\"], \"outcome\": \"Eight per-mode workstreams (deep-research, deep-review, deep-ai-council, deep-improvement, deep-alignment, agent-improvement, model-benchmark, skill-benchmark), each a fractal parent with full behavior + typed schema + reducers + sealed artifacts + certificates + resume adapters + shadow parity + rollback switch + mode gate; deep-improvement common precedes its 3 variants.\" },\n24:     { \"phase\": \"014\", \"slug\": \"staged-state-migration-and-authority-cutover\", \"kind\": \"parent\", \"depends_on\": [\"013\"], \"outcome\": \"Classify + migrate eligible in-flight state; flip authority one mode at a time behind a rollback window + cutover certificate.\" },\n25:     { \"phase\": \"015\", \"slug\": \"legacy-writer-retirement\", \"kind\": \"leaf\", \"depends_on\": [\"014\"], \"outcome\": \"Remove old live emitters + replaced logic after zero-use telemetry + rollback evidence; retain required archival readers.\" },\n26:     { \"phase\": \"016\", \"slug\": \"whole-system-gate\", \"kind\": \"leaf\", \"depends_on\": [\"015\"], \"outcome\": \"Exact-SHA baselines, mode gates, mixed-version replay, crash injection, counterfactual + degeneration tests, parity, blocking SOL review, recursive strict validation.\" },\n27:     { \"phase\": \"017\", \"slug\": \"integrate-latest-and-closeout\", \"kind\": \"leaf\", \"depends_on\": [\"016\"], \"outcome\": \"Integrate latest origin, reopen affected phases on drift, rerun the whole-system gate on the final SHA, reconcile 065 open items + changelogs + packet metadata.\" }\n28:   ],\n29:   \"mode_workstreams_phase_013\": [\n30:     \"001-deep-research\", \"002-deep-review\", \"003-deep-ai-council\", \"004-deep-improvement-common\",\n31:     \"005-agent-improvement\", \"006-model-benchmark\", \"007-skill-benchmark\", \"008-deep-alignment\"\n32:   ],\n33:   \"notes\": [\n34:     \"Research phases 001-002 are read-only inputs; the implementation program is phases 003-017.\",\n35:     \"The live parent now has 44 qualifying direct children; later children record remediation, hardening, review, and executor work beyond the original 001-017 sequence.\",\n36:     \"ai-system-improvement mode is deliberately excluded (operator, run-2).\",\n37:     \"deep-improvement common (mode 004) precedes the three benchmark variants (modes 005/006/007) because they share its packet + scoring backend.\",\n38:     \"bijective_coverage is validated in phase 004; until then the 178-row single-disposition property is unproven.\"\n39:   ]\n40: }\n\n(End of file - total 40 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"packet\": \"system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation\",\n  \"kind\": \"phase-parent\",\n  \"generated_from\": \"GPT-5.6-sol (ultra) design review, verdict REQUESTED_CHANGES, folded in\",\n  \"architecture\": \"single cross-mode spine: typed append-only event ledger + fail-closed transition-authorization gateway + sealed reference artifacts + versioned replay fingerprints + receipts/certificates + blinded/counterfactual adjudication\",\n  \"migration_model\": \"additive-dark substrate -> compatibility adapters + shadow parity -> staged per-mode authority cutover behind rollback window -> gated legacy retirement\",\n  \"live_direct_children\": 44,\n  \"original_program_range\": \"001-017\",\n  \"rec_corpus\": { \"run_a_45iter\": 8, \"run_b_20iter\": 59, \"run_c_40iter\": 111, \"total\": 178 },\n  \"phases\": [\n    { \"phase\": \"001\", \"slug\": \"deep-loop-market-research\", \"kind\": \"research\", \"depends_on\": [], \"outcome\": \"Read-only research input: 8 ranked recommendations (R1-R8) and the market/landscape analysis consumed by the phase-004 ledger.\" },\n    { \"phase\": \"002\", \"slug\": \"deep-loop-effectiveness-and-fanout\", \"kind\": \"research\", \"depends_on\": [], \"outcome\": \"Read-only research input: 59 runtime recommendations + fan-out finding (run 1) and 111 per-mode recommendations (run 2), consumed by the phase-004 ledger.\" },\n    { \"phase\": \"003\", \"slug\": \"baseline-taxonomy-and-state-census\", \"kind\": \"leaf\", \"depends_on\": [], \"outcome\": \"Pin BASE; normalize taxonomy; census subsystems, event schemas, in-flight state, backends, defects-vs-contracts, replay fixtures, rollback anchors.\" },\n    { \"phase\": \"004\", \"slug\": \"architecture-coverage-and-transition-contract\", \"kind\": \"parent\", \"depends_on\": [\"003\"], \"outco